          "module_id": "KB-AUTH-02",
          "kind": "module",
          "text": "Permit held / digital permit. Require operator to check physical/digital permit and whitelist records; distinguish entitlement from display/registration administration. Require the operator to check physical/digital permit and whitelist records. Residential rights supersede generic permit logic.",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "SCOP-permits",
              "title": "Single Code - permits",
              "versioned": true,
